  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7220501",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050101": {
            "id": "722050101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Huh. Funny. I was sure I had it in my pocket...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050104"
            ]
          },
          "722050104": {
            "id": "722050104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "That won't do, we were supposed to pass them to Granny Una...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050105"
            ]
          },
          "722050105": {
            "id": "722050105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "She's grown old and can't remember a ton of things clearly anymore. Recently, she's started going on about things that happened to her when she was young.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050106"
            ]
          },
          "722050106": {
            "id": "722050106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "She's always going on about flowers this and flowers that... She even said that they were flowers from beyond the Sea of Fog, ones that looked both different and very pretty...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050107"
            ]
          },
          "722050107": {
            "id": "722050107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Then one day, I had a dream. I dreamed that the fog that covered the island disappeared with a single \"woosh\"! And there, on the other side of the ocean, stood a tall, huge, beautiful house. It wasn't made of wood... Or made of gold...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050108"
            ]
          },
          "722050108": {
            "id": "722050108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Me too, me too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050109"
            ]
          },
          "722050109": {
            "id": "722050109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "In that dream, I scaled high mountains and climbed great trees, and gathered lots and lots of beautiful flowers. I'd never seen them in my life, but I knew that those were the ones Granny Una was looking before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050110"
            ]
          },
          "722050110": {
            "id": "722050110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "But the flowers were too heavy, so I fell from the tree. I fell and fell and fell... and then I woke up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050111"
            ]
          },
          "722050111": {
            "id": "722050111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Hah! That'll teach you to be so greedy. I said we'd gotten enough of them already, but noooo, you didn't listen! And I ended up falling out of the tree together with you, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050112"
            ]
          },
          "722050112": {
            "id": "722050112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Well, our pockets are empty now, and the stuff's all gone... How are we going to face Granny Una like this?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220502",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050201": {
            "id": "722050201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "What are we going to do...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050202"
            ]
          },
          "722050202": {
            "id": "722050202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Well, you think of something, will you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220503",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722051301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722051301": {
            "id": "722051301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Yeah! Those are the ones! Wow-wee, they're just like the ones in my dream!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051302"
            ]
          },
          "722051302": {
            "id": "722051302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Thanks so much!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051303"
            ]
          },
          "722051303": {
            "id": "722051303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Kito, once we've gone to see Granny Una, let's head to the beach on the east side to play! You can see Shourai Shrine from over there, y'know!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051304"
            ]
          },
          "722051304": {
            "id": "722051304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "It's Chirai Shrine, come on..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220512",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050301": {
            "id": "722050301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Hello there!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050304"
            ]
          },
          "722050304": {
            "id": "722050304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Thanks for helping us get those flowers! Still, I've got to say that something's fishy around here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050305"
            ]
          },
          "722050305": {
            "id": "722050305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Me too. I mean, it's odd, isn't it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050306"
            ]
          },
          "722050306": {
            "id": "722050306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Every time we go to a different place, we always meet unhappy people... And no one can hear what anyone else is saying...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050307"
            ]
          },
          "722050307": {
            "id": "722050307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "And every time we find a beautiful flower, pick it up, and put it in our bags, it goes missing super quick!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220504",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050401": {
            "id": "722050401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "I can't leave just yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050402"
            ]
          },
          "722050402": {
            "id": "722050402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "If Kito's not leaving, I'm not leaving either!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220505",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722051501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722051501": {
            "id": "722051501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Thanks! We'll bring these flowers back to Granny Una!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051502"
            ]
          },
          "722051502": {
            "id": "722051502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Hey, Kito, give me half!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051503"
            ]
          },
          "722051503": {
            "id": "722051503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Let's go to the other side of the mountain. There's some great places to play in the Autake Plains to the southwest!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051504"
            ]
          },
          "722051504": {
            "id": "722051504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Chise's gonna be so mad at us... But whatever, I wanna go too!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220513",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050501": {
            "id": "722050501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Looks like we meet again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050502"
            ]
          },
          "722050502": {
            "id": "722050502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Hello again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050505"
            ]
          },
          "722050505": {
            "id": "722050505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Yup, still here! By the way, do you know what this big rock is used for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050506"
            ]
          },
          "722050506": {
            "id": "722050506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Hehe! Kito knows everything, don'cha know?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220506",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050601": {
            "id": "722050601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Do the other islands have big glowing mushrooms, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050602"
            ]
          },
          "722050602": {
            "id": "722050602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Bet they don't look as nice as the ones we grow, though!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220507",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722051701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722051701": {
            "id": "722051701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Ooh, so you still remember! Nice, thanks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051702"
            ]
          },
          "722051702": {
            "id": "722051702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Thanks a bunch!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051703"
            ]
          },
          "722051703": {
            "id": "722051703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "We're going to the river down south to fish for some shells! See you later!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051704"
            ]
          },
          "722051704": {
            "id": "722051704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Hey, Kina, don't wade into the river! It's dangerous!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220514",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050701": {
            "id": "722050701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Hey there, we meet again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050702"
            ]
          },
          "722050702": {
            "id": "722050702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Kito doesn't feel like talking much today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050705"
            ]
          },
          "722050705": {
            "id": "722050705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "It's... It's nothing. I'll play by myself today. Don't worry about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050706"
            ]
          },
          "722050706": {
            "id": "722050706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Well, would you look at that. He's sulking all by himself again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220508",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050801": {
            "id": "722050801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "I'm fine. I'll be fine even if I play by myself!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050802"
            ]
          },
          "722050802": {
            "id": "722050802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "And you're not by yourself, anyway. You've got me!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220509",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722051901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722051901": {
            "id": "722051901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Ooh! Thanks so much!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051902"
            ]
          },
          "722051902": {
            "id": "722051902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Sorry for troubling you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051903"
            ]
          },
          "722051903": {
            "id": "722051903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "C'mon, Kito, I know a great place where we can have an adventure! There's a mountain hollow on the north side of Mt. Senna. It's real secret and everything!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722051904"
            ]
          },
          "722051904": {
            "id": "722051904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "It's called Mt. Kanna..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7220515",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722050901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722050901": {
            "id": "722050901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Hello there!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050902"
            ]
          },
          "722050902": {
            "id": "722050902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Hey!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050905"
            ]
          },
          "722050905": {
            "id": "722050905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "Thank you, but we won't need anything this time. We're leaving soon... We're going to the land without fog.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050906"
            ]
          },
          "722050906": {
            "id": "722050906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "We're gonna go see the big, shiny, golden house, and we're gonna ride on a boat to get there!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050907"
            ]
          },
          "722050907": {
            "id": "722050907",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "But before we go, we still need to thank you... Also, could you please pass this to Granny Una for us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050908"
            ]
          },
          "722050908": {
            "id": "722050908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Place this in her hand, and she'll stop worrying and come with us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050909"
            ]
          },
          "722050909": {
            "id": "722050909",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kito",
            "text": "We're counting on you one last time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722050910"
            ]
          },
          "722050910": {
            "id": "722050910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kina",
            "text": "Thank you so much."
          }
        }
      }
    },
